function mSale(id){modal('Record Sale',`<div class="fr">${sel('Product','f1',popt(),'w')}${fld('Quantity','f2','number','required min="1" value="1"')}${fld('Selling Price (₹)','f3','number','required min="0" step="0.01"')}${fld('Date','f4','date','required value="'+TODAY+'"','w')}</div><div class="info"><div><span>Current Stock</span><b id="cs"></b></div><div><span>Remaining Stock</span><b id="rs"></b></div><div><span>Total Amount</span><b id="ta"></b></div></div>`,'Record Sale',g=>{const p=byId(g('f1')),q=+g('f2');if(q>p.stock){toast(`Only ${p.stock} units of ${p.name} in stock`,1);return false}const pv=stat(p);p.stock-=q;S.sales.push({id:Date.now(),product:p.name,quantity:q,price:+g('f3'),date:g('f4')});S.mv.out+=q;log('sale',`${p.name} × ${q}`);changed(p,pv);renderAll();toast('Sale recorded successfully')},()=>{const s=$('#f1'),u=()=>{const p=byId(s.value);if(p){$('#f3').value=p.sellingPrice;$('#cs').textContent=p.stock+' units'}};const t=()=>{const p=byId(s.value),q=+$('#f2').value||0;$('#rs').textContent=p?Math.max(0,p.stock-q)+' units':'';$('#ta').textContent=inr(q*(+$('#f3').value||0))};['f2','f3'].forEach(k=>$('#'+k).oninput=t);s.onchange=()=>{u();t()};if(id)s.value=id;u();t()})}
